R^{*}}(v)\geq rd~|~\bigcap_{B\in\mathcal{B}}\overline{B}\right)=\mathbb{P}\left(d_{R^{*}}(v)\geq rd\right)&lt;\frac{1}{e3d^{3}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
