<p id="S4.SS2.p7.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.SS2.p7.2.1" class="ltx_text">Note <math id="S4.SS2.p7.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Z=|U^{*}(v)|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msup><mi>U</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z=|U^{*}(v)|</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="S4.SS2.p8" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS2.p8.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.SS2.p8.1.1" class="ltx_text">We shall first bound <math id="S4.SS2.p8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{E}(Z)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{E}(Z)</annotation></semantics></math>. Consider any given <math id="S4.SS2.p8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>. Suppose <math id="S4.SS2.p8.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>A</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A</annotation></semantics></math> fixes exactly <math id="S4.SS2.p8.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d^{\prime}\leq d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>≤</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d^{\prime}\leq d</annotation></semantics></math> distinct colours in <math id="S4.SS2.p8.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N_{G}(w_{i})\smallsetminus N_{G}(v)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>G</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>G</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N_{G}(w_{i})\smallsetminus N_{G}(v)</annotation></semantics></math>.
Then <math id="S4.SS2.p8.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Z_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>Z</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> shall be valued <math id="S4.SS2.p8.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0</annotation></semantics></math> if <math id="S4.SS2.p8.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> is assigned a colour <math id="S4.SS2.p8.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>C</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C</annotation></semantics></math> distinct from all the <math id="S4.SS2.p8.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>d</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math> colours in <math id="S4.SS2.p8.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N_{G}(w_{i})\smallsetminus N_{G}(v)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>G</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>G</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N_{G}(w_{i})\smallsetminus N_{G}(v)</annotation></semantics></math> and moreover, no vertex in <math id="S4.SS2.p8.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N_{G}(v)\smallsetminus\{w_{i}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>G</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∖</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N_{G}(v)\smallsetminus\{w_{i}\}</annotation></semantics></math> is assigned <math id="S4.SS2.p8.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>C</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C</annotation></semantics></math>. Thus, as <math id="S4.SS2.p8.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1-x\geq e^{-\frac{x}{1-x}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>≥</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1-x\geq e^{-\frac{x}{1-x}}</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="S4.SS2.p8.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0\leq x&lt;1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0\leq x&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S4.SS2.p8.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="e^{-x}\geq 1-x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">e^{-x}\geq 1-x</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
</div>
