<div id="S4.SS3.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS3.p5.1" class="ltx_p">As for every <math id="S4.SS3.p5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v\in U" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v\in U</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S4.SS3.p5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d=d_{G}(v)=d_{T}(v)=d_{U^{e}}(v)+d_{T\smallsetminus U^{e}}(v)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>G</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><msup><mi>U</mi><mi>e</mi></msup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>∖</mo><msup><mi>U</mi><mi>e</mi></msup></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d=d_{G}(v)=d_{T}(v)=d_{U^{e}}(v)+d_{T\smallsetminus U^{e}}(v)</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S4.SS3.p5.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d_{H_{0}}(v)=d_{T_{0}}(v)=d_{U^{e}_{0}}(v)+d_{T_{0}\smallsetminus U^{e}_{0}}(v)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><msubsup><mi>U</mi><mn>0</mn><mi>e</mi></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>∖</mo><msubsup><mi>U</mi><mn>0</mn><mi>e</mi></msubsup></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{H_{0}}(v)=d_{T_{0}}(v)=d_{U^{e}_{0}}(v)+d_{T_{0}\smallsetminus U^{e}_{0}}(v)</annotation></semantics></math>, then by (<a href="#S4.E12" title="In 4.3. Decomposition of 𝐺 to two similar subgraphs ‣ 4. Proof of Theorem ‣ Decomposability of regular graphs to 4 locally irregular subgraphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.12</span></a>) and (<a href="#S4.E13" title="In 4.3. Decomposition of 𝐺 to two similar subgraphs ‣ 4. Proof of Theorem ‣ Decomposability of regular graphs to 4 locally irregular subgraphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.13</span></a>),</p>
